# Qantara LAN HTTPS example
#
# Replace `qantara.local` with a hostname that resolves to your LAN machine,
# or use a trusted internal domain you control.
#
# The Python gateway continues to run behind Caddy on an internal port.
# Caddy forwards the browser's Host header (qantara.local), which is not a
# loopback name, so the gateway must have QANTARA_AUTH_TOKEN set; without a
# token it refuses non-loopback requests. See ops/README.md.

qantara.local {
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8899
}
